WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Choose the learner placement
Build or edit this learner's training plan. Choose the programme and applicable cohort and group. Check the learner name before continuing.

2
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:20.100
Build the learning content
Add modules from the selected programme. Each module brings its authored weeks and activities. Check the content counts and planned hours.

3
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:30.018
Review and save
Review the full plan before saving. Back returns to an earlier step. Saving applies the plan to this learner, so check the placement and content carefully.
